		width: 18px;
		height: 18px;
		margin-right: 4px;
	}
	.nav-back-text {
		font-size: 16px;
		color: #1A1A1A;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.nav-title {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 17px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1A1A1A;
	}
	.nav-bar { background-color: #FFFFFF; border-width: 0; border-color: #FFFFFF; padding-right: 96px; }
	.nav-right {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		margin-left: 10px;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1A73E8;
	}
	.body {
		flex: 1;
		padding: 8px 16px 0 16px;
	}
	.card {
		background-color: #FFFFFF;
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 16px;
		margin-bottom: 12px;
		border-width: 1px;
		border-style: solid;
		border-color: #E5E7EB;
	}
	.label {
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #1A1A1A;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}
	.chips {
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.chip {
		padding: 7px 12px;
		border-radius: 16px;
		background-color: #E8EEF8;
		border-width: 1px;
		border-style: solid;
		border-color: #C5D0E0;
		margin-right: 8px;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}
	.chip-on {
		background-color: #1A73E8;
		border-color: #1A73E8;
	}
	.chip-text {
		font-size: 13px;
